Package: openvdbr
Type: Package
Title: Sparse Volumetric Grids with 'OpenVDB'
Version: 13.1.0-4
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tyler", "Morgan-Wall", email = "tylermw@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3131-3814")),
    person("Contributors to the OpenVDB Project", role = c("ctb", "cph")),
    person("Blosc Development Team", role = "cph"))
Description: Creates, edits, and samples sparse volumetric grids using
    'OpenVDB' <https://www.openvdb.org/>. Supports signed distance fields,
    constructive solid geometry, conversion between triangle meshes and
    volumes, file exchange, and a native runtime interface.
